| G6 | pass | four attacks × 8 seeds, 0 successes; reference and compact routes each 8/8 |
| G7 | pass | `n` 60→120 and edges 180→360 with answer length fixed |
| G8 | pass | 80/80 invariance and carried-witness checks; 20/20 unrelated keys distinct |
| G9 | **blocked** | size caps pass: 51 chars, 13 estimated tokens, 25 atoms, 204 operations; no scored oracle attempt |

The four failing attacks are equal-degree outlier selection, eight-restart
coordinate descent, 256 uniform structured restarts, and an in-context affine
ansatz of Hamming weight at most two. A broader non-gated audit over 100 fresh
shipping seeds gave 0/100 for every one of these attacks and 100/100 for both
the reference and compact algorithms. Another construction audit checked 4,000
instances across the four presets.

