+"""Exact tensor-dependence generator for arXiv:1303.6914.
+
+At n=6 the construction supplies sixteen simple tensors in Q^3 x Q^6 x Q^6.
+The positive and negative halves of the returned dependence are two distinct
+eight-term decompositions of the same tensor, mirroring the paper's exceptional
+3 x 6 x 6, rank-eight non-identifiability in an exactly checkable special family.
+"""
