+        "An ordered vector of m=2n+4 pairwise-distinct, nonzero reduced rationals "
+        "lambda_i=[numerator,denominator]. Each numerator has absolute value at "
+        "most H=binomial(2n+3,n+1), and each positive denominator is at most 7."
+    ),
