codex
The cap-compliant redesign is now in place. It stays exactly in the paper’s \(3\times6\times6\), eight-summand setting at every non-demo preset and keeps the witness at 16 rationals. Difficulty now comes from random paired nodes and large exact barycentric denominators; the compact route remains 136 operations, while generic exact flattening takes about 12,800 rational operations. This removes the ineffective “more basis mixing” escalation.
