Implemented the native Track B generator based on the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/1303.6914).

- [gen_1303_6914.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1303.6914/gen_1303_6914.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1303.6914/selftest_report.json)
